select id, 'open', 'L', 'オンライン英会話講師', '社会人の受講生を対象に、25分間のマンツーマン英会話レッスンを担当していただきます。教材は当社で用意します。夜の時間帯（19時〜23時）のうち、週6コマ以上ご都合のよい枠を開けてください。', 'Online English conversation tutor', 'Teach 25-minute one-to-one conversation lessons to adult learners in Japan after their workday. Lesson materials are provided; you bring patience and a clear speaking voice. Open at least six slots a week, whenever suits you inside the evening window.', array['Run 25-minute video lessons from the provided curriculum', 'Write a three-line feedback note after each lesson', 'Keep at least six evening slots open per week'], array['Native or near-native English', 'Stable connection, headset and webcam', 'Teaching experience or a TEFL certificate is a plus'], array['teaching', 'ESL', 'conversation', 'TEFL', 'tutoring'], array['English (native or near-native)'],
  0, 1800, 'hr', 1800, 6, 15,
