select id, 'open', 'T', 'アニメ字幕翻訳者（日本語→スペイン語）', '中南米向け配信用に、毎週放送されるアニメの字幕翻訳とタイミング調整をお願いします。月曜日に日本語台本と映像をお渡しし、72時間以内に納品していただきます。敬称・画面テロップ・歌詞の扱いはスタイルガイドに沿ってください。', 'Anime subtitle translator, Japanese to Spanish', 'Translate and time subtitles for weekly anime episodes headed to Latin American streaming. You receive the Japanese script and video on Monday and deliver within 72 hours. A style guide covers honorifics, on-screen text and song lyrics.', array['Translate one 24-minute episode per week into neutral Latin American Spanish', 'Time subtitles to the video and follow the style guide', 'Flag jokes and cultural references that need a translator''s note'], array['Native Spanish and Japanese around JLPT N2', 'A subtitling sample, or a paid trial episode', 'Comfortable with Aegisub or Subtitle Edit'], array['subtitling', 'translation', 'anime', 'Aegisub', 'timing'], array['Spanish (native)'],
  4, 1100, 'video_minute', 2600, 5, 12,
  null, null, null, now() - interval '3 days'
