select id, 'open', 'T', '英語ローカライズのネイティブチェック（RPG）', '社内で英訳した約30万字のファンタジーRPGのテキストについて、日本語原文と照らし合わせながら英語のネイティブチェックをお願いします。不自然な表現の修正と、キャラクターごとの口調の統一が主な業務です。作業は共有スプレッドシートで週ごとに割り振ります。', 'Native check for an English JRPG script', 'Our in-house team has translated a 300,000-character fantasy RPG into English. Read the English against the Japanese source, fix stiff lines and keep each character''s voice consistent. Work is assigned in weekly batches through a shared spreadsheet.', array['Edit around 8,000 words of game dialogue per week', 'Keep a glossary of names, skills and item terms', 'Leave short notes where the Japanese source is ambiguous'], array['Native English with an ear for dialogue', 'Japanese reading at JLPT N3 or better', 'You have finished at least one JRPG and can say why its writing worked'], array['localization', 'editing', 'proofreading', 'games', 'JRPG', 'writing'], array['English (native)'],
  3, 2600, 'hr', 2600, 5, 10,
  null, null, null, now() - interval '2 days'
from companies where name_en = 'Sakuramichi Games';

