select id, 'open', 'M', '海外向けSNS運用・ショート動画制作（抹茶ブランド）', '宇治で創業120年の茶舗が、海外向けオンラインストアを開設します。店舗スタッフが撮影した素材をもとに、TikTok・Instagram向けのショート動画を週3本企画・編集し、キャプションも作成していただきます。商品理解のため、お茶のサンプルをお送りします。', 'Short-video creator for a matcha brand (US and EU audience)', 'A 120-year-old tea shop in Uji is opening its online store to overseas buyers. Plan and edit three short videos a week for TikTok and Instagram from footage our staff shoot, and write the captions. We send you tea so you know what you are selling.', array['Edit three 20 to 40 second videos per week from supplied footage', 'Write captions and reply to comments in English', 'Join a one-hour planning call every Wednesday'], array['A portfolio of short-form videos you edited', 'Fluent written English. No Japanese needed: our coordinator speaks English', 'Interest in tea, food or Japanese craft'], array['social media', 'TikTok', 'Instagram', 'short video', 'video editing', 'copywriting', 'content'], array['English (fluent)'],
  0, 2200, 'hr', 2200, 8, 12,
