select id, 'open', 'S', '越境ECカスタマーサポート（英語）', '美濃焼の食器を世界30か国に発送しています。お客様からのお問い合わせの多くは日本の深夜に届くため、その時間帯のメール・チャット対応をお願いします。内容は注文状況、破損時の対応、関税に関するご質問などです。倉庫チームとの連絡は簡単な日本語で行います。', 'Customer support for an overseas pottery store (English)', 'We ship Mino-ware tableware to 30 countries, and most customer questions arrive while Japan is asleep. Answer email and chat about orders, breakage claims and customs fees. Our warehouse team writes internal notes in simple Japanese.', array['Reply to 20 to 30 tickets per shift in Zendesk', 'Log breakage claims with photos for the warehouse', 'Suggest FAQ updates when the same question keeps coming'], array['Fluent, friendly written English', 'Japanese at JLPT N4, enough to read short internal notes', 'Support or retail experience'], array['customer support', 'email', 'chat', 'e-commerce', 'Shopify', 'Zendesk'], array['English (fluent)'],
  2, 1600, 'hr', 1600, 10, 20,
  1320, 1560, 'Monday to Friday. You cover the hours when Japan is asleep.', now() - interval '1 days'
from companies where name_en = 'Hinode Pottery';

